pageType: cover
background:
  type: solid
  color: "$primary"
elements:
  - elementId: cover-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [80, 160, 700, 120]
    content:
      style: "$hero"
      align: [left, top]
      text: |
        <p><strong>RV-MalTrace</strong></p>
        <p>深度技术汇报</p>
  - elementId: cover-subtitle
    elementType: text
    bounds: [80, 290, 700, 80]
    content:
      fontSize: 20
      color: "#FFFFFFCC"
      fontFamily: "QuattrocentoSans, MiSans"
      lineHeight: 1.5
      align: [left, top]
      text: |
        <p>受控 RISC-V Linux Workload 的硬件辅助行为重建证据链</p>
        <p>Genesys2 / CVA6 / RVFI</p>
  - elementId: cover-divider
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [80, 390, 80, 4]
    shapeName: rect
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$accent"
  - elementId: cover-claim
    elementType: text
    bounds: [80, 410, 700, 120]
    content:
      fontSize: 16
      color: "#FFFFFFBB"
      fontFamily: "QuattrocentoSans, MiSans"
      lineHeight: 1.6
      align: [left, top]
      text: |
        <p><strong>核心主张</strong>：不是 malware detector 的检测准确率实验，</p>
        <p>而是闭合的一条硬件辅助行为重建证据链。</p>
        <p>硬件捕获处理器提交级事件，通过 标记窗口准入检查、</p>
        <p>ELF/runtime binding、semantic recovery 和 字段来源标签，</p>
        <p>把低层硬件事实恢复成可审查的行为语义。</p>
  - elementId: card-bg-1
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [800, 160, 420, 120]
    shapeName: roundRect
    adjustments: [8000]
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "#FFFFFF"
  - elementId: card-num-1
    elementType: text
    bounds: [820, 175, 200, 55]
    content:
      style: "$dataNumber"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p><strong>128</strong></p>
  - elementId: card-label-1
    elementType: text
    bounds: [820, 230, 200, 30]
    content:
      style: "$dataLabel"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>BOARD REPS ACCEPTED</p>
  - elementId: card-bg-2
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [800, 300, 200, 100]
    shapeName: roundRect
    adjustments: [8000]
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "#1E293B"
  - elementId: card-num-2
    elementType: text
    bounds: [820, 315, 160, 40]
    content:
      fontSize: 36
      color: "$white"
      fontFamily: "QuattrocentoSans, MiSans"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p><strong>142</strong></p>
  - elementId: card-label-2
    elementType: text
    bounds: [820, 355, 160, 25]
    content:
      fontSize: 12
      color: "#FFFFFF99"
      fontFamily: "QuattrocentoSans, MiSans"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>BOARD ATTEMPTS</p>
  - elementId: card-bg-3
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [1020, 300, 200, 100]
    shapeName: roundRect
    adjustments: [8000]
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$light"
  - elementId: card-num-3
    elementType: text
    bounds: [1040, 315, 160, 40]
    content:
      fontSize: 36
      color: "$primary"
      fontFamily: "QuattrocentoSans, MiSans"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p><strong>12</strong></p>
  - elementId: card-label-3
    elementType: text
    bounds: [1040, 355, 160, 25]
    content:
      fontSize: 12
      color: "$secondary"
      fontFamily: "QuattrocentoSans, MiSans"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>WORKLOADS</p>
